# Rust payload: symlinks into the repo root in a dev checkout (chuggie's scripts/dev-setup.sh),
# real copies while scripts/prepack.js is packing. No trailing slashes — these are symlinks as
# often as they are directories, and `/crates/` does not match a symlink.
